{"seq":8,"slug":"mobile-performance","title":"移动端性能与启动优化","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"移动端性能与启动优化-简介\">移动端性能与启动优化 简介</h1><p>移动应用的性能体验直接决定用户留存与商业转化。本知识库系统梳理 iOS 与 Android 双平台的性能优化方法论，从启动速度、渲染流畅度、内存功耗到线上监控形成完整闭环，帮助开发者构建可量化、可持续的性能治理能力。</p>\n<p><strong>适用读者</strong>：具备 1 年以上移动端开发经验，了解基本的 UIKit/Jetpack 组件使用，希望从「能跑」迈向「跑得好」的 iOS/Android 工程师；亦适合负责性能专项的技术负责人建立系统化思路。</p>\n<p>本知识库包含四章内容：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>启动优化与冷启动治理</strong>，解析冷启动全链路耗时模型，介绍延迟初始化与按需加载的工程实践，建立启动指标体系与持续监控机制。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>渲染性能与流畅度优化</strong>，聚焦帧率与卡顿治理、布局渲染管线瓶颈定位、列表滚动与复杂视图场景下的性能调优技术。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>内存与功耗管理</strong>，覆盖内存泄漏检测与治理、后台任务功耗控制、资源加载策略与包体积瘦身等实战课题。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>性能监控与劣化防护体系</strong>，讲解 APM 架构设计与端上采集方案、自动化劣化检测流水线以及以用户体验为核心的数据驱动优化闭环。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：初学者建议按章节顺序学习，从启动到渲染再到内存与监控层层递进；有特定性能痛点的读者可直接跳至对应章节深入实践。每章均配有 Mermaid 架构图与实测数据案例，鼓励在自有项目中验证所学。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"startup-optimization","title":"启动优化与冷启动治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/startup-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cold-start-analysis","title":"冷启动耗时分析与优化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/startup-optimization/cold-start-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lazy-initialization","title":"延迟初始化与按需加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/startup-optimization/lazy-initialization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"startup-metrics-monitoring","title":"启动指标体系与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/startup-optimization/startup-metrics-monitoring"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rendering-performance","title":"渲染性能与流畅度优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/rendering-performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frame-rate-optimization","title":"帧率优化与卡顿治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/rendering-performance/frame-rate-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"layout-rendering-pipeline","title":"布局与渲染管线优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/rendering-performance/layout-rendering-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"list-scrolling-performance","title":"列表滚动与复杂视图性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/rendering-performance/list-scrolling-performance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-power-optimization","title":"内存与功耗管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/memory-power-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"memory-management-leaks","title":"内存管理与泄漏检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/memory-power-optimization/memory-management-leaks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"power-consumption-optimization","title":"功耗优化与后台任务管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/memory-power-optimization/power-consumption-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"resource-loading-strategy","title":"资源加载策略与包体积治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/memory-power-optimization/resource-loading-strategy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"performance-monitoring","title":"性能监控与劣化防护体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/performance-monitoring","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"apm-architecture","title":"APM 架构与端上采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/performance-monitoring/apm-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-regression-detection","title":"性能劣化检测与自动化防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/performance-monitoring/performance-regression-detection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"user-experience-metrics","title":"用户体验指标与数据驱动优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-performance/performance-monitoring/user-experience-metrics"}]}]}